 ('ENT_HTT_INARAS','member_of','ENT_HTT_PANTHEON','high','Inara(s) is the Hittite protective/tutelary goddess of the Illuyanka myth.'),
 ('ENT_HTT_HUTENA','member_of','ENT_HTT_PANTHEON','high','Hutena and Hutellura are the Hurrian/Hittite goddesses of fate and birth.'),
 ('ENT_HTT_MEZZULLA','member_of','ENT_HTT_PANTHEON','high','Mezzulla, daughter of the Sun Goddess of Arinna, belongs to the Arinna cult.'),
